Sure. But I guess what I'm saying too, is that like, all right, so let's, you know, if you have

00:15:39.680 --> 00:15:40.780
the power pad, right.

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:46.760
I'm still saying that the responsiveness of the, of even just the game itself, as I was

00:15:46.760 --> 00:15:51.300
playing it, like the way that the jump in this game works and the, and the hurdles and stuff

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:56.840
with that, and how you, you know, how you have to time it, it's not, it doesn't feel as responsive

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:59.380
and intuitive as track and field.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:04.260
I found it to, I mean, I found it to be more precise than you're making it out to be, but

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:05.560
I guess, I don't know.

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:07.000
